# Dior Homme Parfum 2014 — 83-Material Inventory Reconstruction V1

## Target identity

This targets the **2014 François Demachy Dior Homme Parfum, public formula code #08642/A**, not the later Francis Kurkdjian Dior Homme Parfum introduced with a different iris-and-amber-wood architecture.

## Truth statement

No authenticated Dior production concentrate formula was found publicly. The proprietary recipe appears to remain a trade secret. This reconstruction combines:

- historical Dior note and brand descriptions;
- the old public allergen/INCI list;
- a commercial secondary GC-MS summary reporting 83 ingredients;
- peer-reviewed irone literature;
- patents that reveal how distinct iris, sandalwood, patchouli, oud and leather functions are commonly constructed;
- the exact 231-material inventory supplied by the user.

The result is an **83-row evidence-constrained center hypothesis**, not a claim that these are Dior's exact 83 identities or doses.

## Why 83 rows

The secondary GC-MS archive reports 83 ingredients. I used that as a complexity target, while refusing to invent an exact proprietary chromatogram. Each row must carry a separate function; the count is not padded with duplicated dilutions or unavailable materials.

## Block design

| Block | Raw µL per 1,000 µL concentrate | Raw % | Purpose |
|---|---:|---:|---|
| Iris / Violet | 285 | 28.5% | Buttery Tuscan-orris, powder, violet, root, and green rhizome complexity |
| Woods / Sandal / Oud | 285 | 28.5% | Sri Lankan-sandalwood effect, cedar, vetiver, amber woods, and controlled oud darkness |
| Leather / Resin | 110 | 11.0% | Smooth dark leather with smoky, saffron, animalic, mossy, and balsamic dimensions |
| Musks / Ambrette | 100 | 10.0% | Ambrette seed, pear-skin talc, clean skin musk, and diffusion |
| Rose / Floral | 70 | 7.0% | Damask-rose heart and floral continuity through the leather |
| Top / Spice | 55 | 5.5% | Italian-orange lift, allergen-supported citrus/floral materials, and warm spice |
| Sweet / Fix / Technical | 95 | 9.5% | Coumarinic hay, vanilla, powder, patchouli-cocoa illusion, fixatives, and carrier |
| **Total** | **1,000** | **100.0%** |  |

